  "edge_schema": "mailvora_edge_ga4",
  "prompt": "How many sessions lead to a sign-up, by device? For each device category, count the sessions that started from 1 to 30 November 2025, by event_date, and how many of them had a sign_up. A session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id, counted from its session_start event; leave out session_start events whose user_pseudo_id or ga_session_id is missing. A session had a sign_up when a sign_up event of the same days carries its user_pseudo_id and its ga_session_id. A sign_up that Mailvora's server sent carries no ga_session_id, so it belongs to no session. A sign_up counts for a session when it falls from 1 to 30 November, even on a later day than the session_start; a sign_up after 30 November counts for no session. The device is device.category of the session_start event. Return device_category, sessions and sessions_with_sign_up. Return one row for each device category. Any row order is fine.",
